  "full_text": "I'm sick of Subway. Every meal of the day. Hey, my hair's straight. Look at that. How about that? Hey, let's see what God says. The Comforter. Say, you think I go to God too much when you think? No, no. Let's see. Maybe it makes you. I don't know. Therefore, son of man, speak unto the house of Israel and say unto them, Thus saith the Lord God. Yet in this your fathers have blasphemed me. They have committed a trespass against me. For when I had brought them into the land for which I had lifted up my hand to give it to them, then they saw every high hill and all the thick trees, and they offered their sacrifices and presented their provocations and their offerings. There also they made their sweet savor and poured out their drink offerings. Oh, I do go there for soda. I did get a soda there earlier. And I said to them, what is the high place where do you go? And the name thereof called Bama, unto this day. So, maybe I should drink a little soda. No, I like soda. A little soda. Always something like that. You're good the way you are. Fuck it. Everything's peachy. Except I'm not getting quite so much money. It's okay, you know, a little bit. We got negative cash flow at the moment, which is okay, I guess.",
